{"2411880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SYSTEMCRASH 92", "steam_appid": 2411880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚙️ <strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/cffa9c1925820d9fd36cc89976763adc.poster.avif?t=1787338890\" width=800 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/cffa9c1925820d9fd36cc89976763adc.webm?t=1787338890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/cffa9c1925820d9fd36cc89976763adc.mp4?t=1787338890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🩸 HOW LONG BEFORE THE SYSTEM CRASHES?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYSTEMCRASH92</strong> is a <strong>side-scrolling survival roguelite</strong>. Your weapon fires on its own at whatever is closest — your job is to read the screen, move, dash through the swarm and decide what you take with you. Runs are short, loud, and never the same twice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌀 REALITY SHIFT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One button, and the side-scrolling plane opens up. The world turns into a hologram, the camera swings around behind you, and you move freely in <strong>full 3D</strong> inside a procedural dome — same run, same enemies, same waves, no loading screen. And the enemies notice: they chase, dodge and circle you in three dimensions too. Every activation rolls a different visual signature — cyan and magenta cyber, solar amber, acid-green alien, matrix lime, crimson. Shift back and you land on the exact spot you left.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔩 EVERY RUN ROLLS ITS OWN RULES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the first enemy spawns, the run decides what it wants to be: an <strong>archetype</strong> that reshapes it — floods of swarms, elite hunts, boss sieges, monothematic anomalies — a <strong>mutator</strong> that bends the economy or the tempo, and an optional <strong>contract</strong> that pays in crafting materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/369f63cd9a7333c079fccae3716841b1.poster.avif?t=1787338890\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/369f63cd9a7333c079fccae3716841b1.webm?t=1787338890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/369f63cd9a7333c079fccae3716841b1.mp4?t=1787338890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📈 THE THREAT SCALES TO YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty is not a clock. Your <strong>Threat Level</strong> comes from your own progression: the higher you climb, the tougher every enemy spawns and the earlier the wave curve starts — and the more XP, gold and materials everything drops. Coming back stronger means coming back to a harder system, and being paid for it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤖 METALLIC ALLIES AND CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather minerals to craft <strong>20 weapons</strong>, each with its own damage, fire rate and mana cost, and <strong>12 metallic allies</strong> that orbit you and fight on their own with genuinely distinct mechanics. Seven tiers of mutated enemy each guard a specific mineral, so when you need one you go hunt it down instead of waiting on a random chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/a9a9dab2706621a9a82b339b0e041e3a.poster.avif?t=1787338890\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/a9a9dab2706621a9a82b339b0e041e3a.webm?t=1787338890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/a9a9dab2706621a9a82b339b0e041e3a.mp4?t=1787338890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 PROTOCOLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A permanent tree of <strong>18 nodes</strong> paid in materials, with three keystones that change how the run plays: your auto-attack <strong>chains</strong> to a second target, your dash shockwave <strong>shoves</strong> everything it touches, and a <strong>second ally</strong> orbits in opposite phase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/6a118ca17da6e93b81c5665464c88735.poster.avif?t=1787338890\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/6a118ca17da6e93b81c5665464c88735.webm?t=1787338890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/6a118ca17da6e93b81c5665464c88735.mp4?t=1787338890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👹 BOSSES DON'T WAIT FOR YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No portal, no invitation. An alarm goes off, radial scans ping the exact ground where it will land, and seconds later something enormous is standing there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Real-time side-scrolling action with full controller support<br>🌀 Reality Shift: flip the arena into free 3D, mid-run, at will<br>⚔️ Auto-attack: you move and dodge, the weapon fires<br>💨 Overdrive Dash with i-frames, ghost trail and shockwave<br>