and on the exact spot you left.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔩 EVERY RUN ROLLS ITS OWN RULES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the first enemy spawns, the run decides what it wants to be: an <strong>archetype</strong> that reshapes it — floods of swarms, elite hunts, boss sieges, monothematic anomalies — a <strong>mutator</strong> that bends the economy or the tempo, and an optional <strong>contract</strong> that pays in crafting materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/369f63cd9a7333c079fccae3716841b1.poster.avif?t=1787338890\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/369f63cd9a7333c079fccae3716841b1.webm?t=1787338890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/369f63cd9a7333c079fccae3716841b1.mp4?t=1787338890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📈 THE THREAT SCALES TO YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty is not a clock. Your <strong>Threat Level</strong> comes from your own progression: the higher you climb, the tougher every enemy spawns and the earlier the wave curve starts — and the more XP, gold and materials everything drops. Coming back stronger means coming back to a harder system, and being paid for it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤖 METALLIC ALLIES AND CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather minerals to craft <strong>20 weapons</strong>, each with its own damage, fire rate and mana cost, and <strong>12 metallic allies</strong> that orbit you and fight on their own with genuinely distinct mechanics. Seven tiers of mutated enemy each guard a specific mineral, so when you need one you go hunt it down instead of waiting on a random chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ct